WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:04.930
In the Qur'an, God tells the angels
He will place a deputy on earth.

2
00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:09.110
The angels ask: why place
there one who will shed blood?

3
00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:12.640
God answers: I know what ye know not.

4
00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:16.840
So why, according to the
Qur'an, did God create humans?

5
00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:19.690
And is this life only a waiting room?

6
00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:24.020
In this mission, you'll find three
reasons the Qur'an gives for human life,

7
00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:25.940
and see how they fit together.

8
00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:28.550
Then you'll weigh up whether, for Muslims,

9
00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:32.340
this life matters only as
a preparation for the next.

10
00:00:32.390 --> 00:00:36.430
Your mission: find out why
the Qur'an says humans exist,

11
00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:39.000
and whether this life
is only a waiting room.
